exercises.prompt:
What does this program print? Write the three lines in order, separated by spaces.

```javascript
function f() {
  try {
    console.log("try");
    return "returned";
  } finally {
    console.log("finally");
  }
}
console.log(f());
```

What does this print?

```javascript
try {
  try {
    null.x;
  } catch (e) {
    throw new Error("wrapped", { cause: e });
  }
} catch (e) {
  console.log(e.message, e.cause.name);
}
```

What number does this print?

```javascript
function g() {
  try {
    return 1;
  } finally {
    return 2;
  }
}
console.log(g());
```

